{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達周一宣佈，黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)回歸公司擔任CEO。《華爾街日報》對此表示，這件事再次證明，想罷免一位AI巨頭的CEO並不是一件容易事。在這輪AI熱潮中，已有兩位最受矚目的業界CEO被各自的董事會解僱。但是，這兩次決定都沒能撐過兩周。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587706.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:58:01.329830+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:35:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:51:15.327063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:51:15.327063+00:00","content_hash":"69d3eb09643999b6c1a73160e5806b95110d97948867c7482e3e7c98c35a7602","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}